text_preview = 18.5. Inlet screens clogged
What this means: Inlet screens clogged is treated as the observed symptom or fault condition. Follow the
steps in order and stop when the cause is identified.
Step-by-step procedure

Step 1. Turn the washer off and identify exactly what the washer is doing and at which stage the problem occurs.

